    {
      "id": "claim_6e96b8643c3845d8b1593e2a479140b6",
      "statement": "decompact ends by normalizing its rebuilt SDP through sdpTransform.parse and sdpTransform.write so the output is always a canonically re-serialized SDP, and the test suite verifies round-trip fidelity by parsing both original and decompacted SDP with sdp-transform before comparing.",
